<title>USA: Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were steady.</p>
<p>Steers: Select to Choice 2-4, 1050-1300 lbs 65.00-66.00, few loads mostly Choice 66.50, load and package mostly blacks 67.00. Select 60.00-65.00.</p>
<p>Heifers: Select and Choice 2-4, 950-1250 lbs 65.00-66.00, instances 66.50. Select 60.00-64.50.</p>
</text>
